1380	//
1381	// NOW: SINGLE OWNER per output element across the WHOLE grid. Flatten the 9 specs'
1382	// outputs into one global index space [0, ΣNout) and grid-stride it over all CTAs
1383	// × threads, so each bias output is reduced EXACTLY ONCE and the work is spread
